OL,3,GNEWSAThree men charged over replica
OL,4,Amosque on Moygashel bonfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with the placing
OL,8,Fof a replica mosque on a bonfire in
OL,9,FJuly.
OL,11,FThe bonfire in Moygashel, County
OL,12,FTyrone, was set alight on 10 July 2026.
OL,14,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,15,F(PSNI) previously said it had planned
OL,16,Fto remove the bonfire structure but it
OL,17,Fwas ignited before they had the chance
OL,18,Fto do so.
OL,20,FThe three men face charges related to
OL,21,Fthe displaying of written material to
OL,22,Fstir up hatred or arouse fear.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
